#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Strings to be replaced sometimes need to be very specific to avoid undesired "
"replacements.  This is a common problem with shorter values."
msgstr "有时需要非常精确地指定要替换的字符串，以避免不必要的替换。短值尤其容易遇到这个问题。"

