"referenced.  To change the owner, group, and mode of a configuration file, "
"use:"
msgstr "所有关键字都可以带括号中的可选参数。这些参数依次为所有者、组和模式，并应用于所引用的文件或目录。要更改配置文件的所有者、组和模式，请使用："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:314
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "@sample(games,games,640) etc/config.sample\n"
msgstr "@sample(games,games,640) etc/config.sample\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:318
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The arguments are optional.  If only the group and mode need to be changed, "
"use:"
msgstr "这些参数是可选的。如果只需更改组和模式，请使用："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:322
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "@sample(,games,660) etc/config.sample\n"
msgstr "@sample(,games,660) etc/config.sample\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:328
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If a keyword is used on an crossref:makefiles[makefile-options,optional] "
"entry, it must to be added after the helper:"
msgstr "如果在 crossref:makefiles[makefile-options,可选]条目上使用关键字，必须将其放在辅助标记之后："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:332
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "%%FOO%%@sample etc/orbit.conf.sample\n"
msgstr "%%FOO%%@sample etc/orbit.conf.sample\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:336
#, fuzzy
