"This is because the options plist helpers are used to comment out the line, "
"so they need to be put first.  See crossref:makefiles[options_sub,"
"`OPTIONS_SUB`] for more information."
msgstr "这是因为选项 plist 辅助项会将该行注释掉，因此必须放在前面。更多信息请参见 crossref:makefiles[options_sub,`OPTIONS_SUB`]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:339
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`@desktop-file-utils`"
msgstr "`@desktop-file-utils`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:343
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Will run `update-desktop-database -q` after installation and "
"deinstallation.  _Never_ use directly, add crossref:uses[uses-desktop-file-"
"utils,`USES=desktop-file-utils`] to the [.filename]#Makefile#."
msgstr "安装和卸载后运行 `update-desktop-database -q`。__切勿__直接使用此宏；应在 [.filename]#Makefile# 中添加 crossref:uses[uses-desktop-file-utils,`USES=desktop-file-utils`]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:345
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`@fc` _directory_"
msgstr "`@fc` _目录_"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:348
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Add a `@dir` entry for the directory passed as an argument, and run `fc-"
"cache -fs` on that directory after installation and deinstallation."
msgstr "为作为参数传入的目录添加一个 `@dir` 条目，并在安装和卸载后对该目录运行 `fc-cache -fs`。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:350
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`@fontsdir` _directory_"
msgstr "`@fontsdir` _目录_"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:354
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Add a `@dir` entry for the directory passed as an argument, and run "
"`mkfontscale` and `mkfontdir` on that directory after installation and "
"deinstallation.  Additionally, on deinstallation, it removes the [."
"filename]#fonts.scale# and [.filename]#fonts.dir# cache files if they are "
"empty."
msgstr "为作为参数传入的目录添加 `@dir` 条目，并在安装和卸载后对该目录运行 `mkfontscale` 和 `mkfontdir`。此外，卸载时，如果 [.filename]#fonts.scale# 和 [.filename]#fonts.dir# 缓存文件为空，则将其删除。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:356
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`@info` _file_"
msgstr "`@info` __文件__"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:362
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Add the file passed as argument to the plist, and updates the info document "
"index on installation and deinstallation.  Additionally, it removes the "
"index if empty on deinstallation.  This should never be used manually, but "
"always through `INFO`.  See crossref:makefiles[makefile-info,Info Files] for "
"more information."
msgstr "将作为参数传入的文件添加到 plist，并在安装和卸载时更新 info 文档索引。此外，卸载时，如果索引为空，则将其删除。切勿手动使用此功能，而应始终通过 `INFO` 使用。更多信息请参见 crossref:makefiles[makefile-info,Info Files]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:364
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`@kld` _directory_"
msgstr "`@kld` __目录__"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:368
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Runs `kldxref` on the directory on installation and deinstallation.  "
"Additionally, on deinstallation, it will remove the directory if empty."
msgstr "安装和卸载时，在该目录上运行 `kldxref`。此外，卸载时，如果该目录为空，则将其删除。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:370
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`@rmtry` _file_"
msgstr "`@rmtry` __文件__"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:373
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Will remove the file on deinstallation, and not give an error if the file is "
"not there."
msgstr "卸载时删除该文件；如果文件不存在，则不报错。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:375
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`@sample` _file_ [_file_]"
msgstr "`@sample` __文件__ [__文件__]"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:379
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is used to handle installation of configuration files, through example "
"files bundled with the package.  The \"actual\", non-sample, file is either "
"the second filename, if present, or the first filename without the [."
"filename]#.sample# extension."
msgstr "此功能用于通过软件包中附带的示例文件来处理配置文件的安装。“实际”文件（非示例文件）是第二个文件名（如果有），否则是去掉 [.filename]#.sample# 扩展名后的第一个文件名。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:384
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This does three things. First, add the first file passed as argument, the "
"sample file, to the plist.  Then, on installation, if the actual file is not "
"found, copy the sample file to the actual file.  And finally, on "
"deinstallation, remove the actual file if it has not been modified.  See "
"crossref:plist[plist-config, Configuration Files] for more information."
msgstr "此功能会执行三项操作。首先，将作为参数传入的第一个文件（示例文件）添加到 plist。然后，安装时，如果找不到实际文件，则将示例文件复制为实际文件。最后，卸载时，如果实际文件未被修改，则将其删除。更多信息请参见 crossref:plist[plist-config, Configuration Files]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:386
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`@shared-mime-info` _directory_"
msgstr "`@shared-mime-info` __目录__"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:389
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Runs `update-mime-database` on the directory on installation and "
"deinstallation."
msgstr "安装和卸载时，在该目录上运行 `update-mime-database`。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:391
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`@shell` _file_"
msgstr "`@shell` __文件__"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:394
#, fuzzy
msgid "Add the file passed as argument to the plist."
msgstr "将作为参数传入的文件添加到 plist。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/plist/_index.adoc:397
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"On installation, add the full path to _file_ to [.filename]#/etc/shells#, "
"while making sure it is not added twice.  On deinstallation, remove it from "
"[.filename]#/etc/shells#."
msgstr "安装时，将 __文件__ 的完整路径添加到 [.filename]#/etc/shells#，并确保不会重复添加。卸载时，将其从 [.filename]#/etc/shells# 中移除。"

#. type: Title ===
